[{"id":"linux-roadmap-order","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["入门路线","学习顺序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/89ce5b85/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"Linux(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/89ce5b85/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Linux 课程可以从哪一篇开始，进阶路线是否会阻塞综合实战？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>建议先读入门路线，再从第 2 篇进入主线；进阶路线是可选篇，不会阻塞综合实战。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>入门路线负责说明环境、依赖和验证方式。主线文章按命令行、文件、文本、Shell、权限、进程、网络、日志、性能和自动化递进；进阶路线用于按需拓展。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]